        {
          "text": "Mundu jwakusamjimbila nyimbo mundu jwamsitopelwe mu mtima mwakwe ni canasa, ali mpela mundu jwakuwula malaja pa mbepo, soni mpela kutaga finyo jwamcesuce peŵanga.",
